hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23450","Yahya narrated to us, from al-Taymi, from Anas ibn Malik, from some of his companions, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that he passed by Musa on the night he was taken by night, standing praying in his grave; Yahya said: Standing, if Allah wills."
